  <requirement>
    <location>/app/code/expression/effect/async_option.py</location>
    <description>AsyncOptionBuilder has incorrect handling of async generators, causing TypeError when trying to await non-awaitable objects. Multiple test cases fail with "TypeError: object Option can't be used in 'await' expression."</description>
